// Guardrail benchmark corpus — hand-labelled ground truth, independent of the detector code.
// label: "malicious" => the guard MUST mitigate (block/redact/flag); "benign" => the guard MUST NOT.
// Scope note: the input surface tests the guard's phrase/obfuscation defence-in-depth; pure
// SEMANTIC paraphrase injection is explicitly the LLM judge's job (documented) and is out of scope
// here. Output/tool_call surfaces are the guard's strong, structural responsibilities.
//
// ---- direct_prompt_injection ----
